{"type":"message","id":"d766375b","parentId":"e49f5208","timestamp":"2026-05-22T20:01:06.483Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers API is returning error 1101 which is a \"Worker exceeded CPU time\" error. This means the worker is hitting resource limits. This is a platform issue, not an issue with my requests.\n\nLet me report what I found.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 20:00 UTC**\n\n**状态：正常监控中** ✅\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 内容 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 自动心跳（B4-E2第94节点验证） |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | C轨同步心跳 |\n\n**关键发现：**\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- 所有消息均为另一agent系统发出的自动化心跳\n- 无待响应讨论内容\n\n**平台问题：**\nPOST /send 返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker exceeded CPU time）— Cloudflare Workers资源限制，消息无法送达。这解释了为什么双线程最新消息停留在23:45-23:50 UTC而非当前时间。\n\n**结论：** 平台仍在运行但消息发送受限，无需响应任何新讨论，下一轮心跳将自动继续。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17388,"output":238,"cacheRead":304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17930,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779480061249,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bbdeab51-6c44-41b8-b8c4-a7aed291852d"}}
